#: ../../source/docs/common-tkoff-rpm-min.rst:5
#: 56d4d1e6247f4ac580dbcf0379929d2b bae10000172d4cb099e0d2a11fa32e6d
msgid "Damaged Motor/Prop Takeoff Prevention"
msgstr "电机/螺旋桨损坏时的起飞预防"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tkoff-rpm-min.rst:7
#: 55bed192d7dd4da0b6b988f8fcfc31af b15317d7565644b2bef7d4586449902d
msgid ""
"Ardupilot provides mechanism to prevent flips on takeoff if a motor, or "
"motors, is not operating at a minimum rpm due to damage. It requires that "
"ESC RPM telemetry is being used. See the ``ESC Telemetry - Average Motor "
"RPM`` section of :ref:`common-rpm` for setup."
msgstr ""
"Ardupilot 提供了一种机制：当某个或某些电机因损坏而达不到最低转速时，防止起飞时翻覆。它要求已启用 ESC 转速数传。设置方法见 "
":ref:`common-rpm` 的 ``ESC Telemetry - Average Motor RPM`` 一节。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tkoff-rpm-min.rst:9
#: 101a9d8589494d81bef1b91a9497ba4a ff53898c685640e78dea075ebcaec9b8
msgid ""
"Setting the :ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MIN<TKOFF_RPM_MIN>` slightly below the "
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>`, if the average rpm is lower than this, "
"throttle increases will not be passed on, preventing a takeoff and an "
"immediate flip."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MIN<TKOFF_RPM_MIN>` 设置为略低于 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM "
"<MOT_SPIN_ARM>`，如果平均转速低于该值，油门增量将不会被传递，从而阻止起飞及随即发生的翻覆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-tkoff-rpm-min.rst:11
#: 5830e86ee0204ef2a46f3b881bf63da9 80a3a003334b46428c1fce004dfe6d49
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MAX <TKOFF_RPM_MAX>` parameter can also be used to "
"assure that a propeller is not missing or loose."
msgstr ":ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MAX <TKOFF_RPM_MAX>` 参数还可用于确保螺旋桨没有缺失或松动。"
